          "type": "object",
          "description": "云硬盘镜像的元数据。\n> 说明:\n> \n> 关于“volume_image_metadata”字段的详细说明,具体请参见:\"[查询镜像详情](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-ims/ims_03_0703.html)\"。",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": ""
          },
          "x-huawei-extraAnnotation": ""
        },
        "volume_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "云硬盘类型。\n目前支持\"SATA\",\"SAS\",\"GPSSD\",\"SSD\",\"ESSD\",\"GPSSD2\",\"ESSD2\"七种。\n\n- \"SATA\"为普通IO云硬盘\n- \"SAS\"为高IO云硬盘\n- \"GPSSD\"为通用型SSD云硬盘\n- \"SSD\"为超高IO云硬盘\n- \"ESSD\"为极速IO云硬盘\n- \"GPSSD2\"为通用型SSD V2云硬盘\n- \"ESSD2\"为极速型SSD V2云硬盘"
        },
        "size": {
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "int32",
          "description": "云硬盘大小,单位为GB。"
        },
        "consistencygroup_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "预留属性。"
        },
